    "sections": {
        "description": "Carpets and Rugs is a clean and structured theme tailored for businesses in the flooring and interior decor sectors, including those focused on deck carpet and beautiful interior designs for kitchens and bathrooms. This versatile theme is ideal for carpet stores, rug sellers, interior designers, home decor shops, wholesalers, and small business owners looking to effectively showcase their products, catalogs, and services online. It features well-organized product sections, various gallery layouts, customizable color schemes, typography options, and a responsive design that works seamlessly on both mobile and desktop devices. The theme also supports high-quality product images, collections, contact forms, and location details, making it perfect for online stores and business websites alike. With straightforward layout settings, engaging banner sections, product grids, and dedicated service pages, users can effortlessly create a professional online presence for home decor, flooring services, and interior design portfolios that include carpets, rugs, mats, and beautiful furnishing products."
    },
